==Strategy==
Due to the presence of high-magnification Alien enemies, it's not recommended to challenge this gauntlet until all [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]] have been collected.

Before hitting the base, stall the Imperator Sael with [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]], and/or [[Ancient Egg: N108 (Super Rare Cat)|Soap Cat]]. Wait until the Zomboes have burrowed and resurfaced, and then use a Zombie Killer [[:Category:Nuker-class Cats|Nuker]] like [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] or [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]] to dispose of them. [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Cleanerbot/Green Shell Cat]] is especially great for stalling them, as it can force the Zomboes to burrow early. Once the boss has been summoned, use strong [[:Category:Sniper-class Cats|Snipers]] like [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]], [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Crimson Mina]], and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] to wear the backliners down, all while protecting them with the aforementioned tankers. You can also burst down Bears Be Back and/or Cala Maria with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], especially after they've been chipped at by your snipers.

While only obtainable later in the game, [[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Fried Chicken Cat]] can make this stage significantly easier by cursing Bears Be Back, Calamary, and Chickful A., making it easier for your attackers to shred them.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
* Strong Generalist [[:Category:Sniper-class Cats|Snipers]]/[[:Category:Super-Backliner-class Cats|Super-Backliners]]: The high range of both Cala Mary and Bears Be Back means that most decent Ubers with more than 500 range will do well against this gauntlet. Some particularly good examples include [[Sea Serpent Daliasan (Uber Rare Cat)|Sea Serpent Daliasan]], [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Radiant Aphrodite]], [[Child of Destiny Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Destiny Phonoa]], and [[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Ultima Galaxy Cosmo]].
* [[Count Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Count Yukimura]]: Count Yukimura can deal significant burst damage to Bears Be Back and Cala Maria, with his Survive (guaranteed in True Form) ensuring that he can land multiple hits on them.
* [[Catman (Uber Rare Cat)|Dark Catman]]: Dark Catman's Massive Damage against both Aliens and Angels means that he can deal significant damage to all of the primary threats of this gauntlet, though do note he fails to outrange Calamary.

